Z||000000||Smokin' GT||12-12-2001||02:35 AM||||Hi guys. At this point I'm not really into doing a conversion (although I will in the future) and I want maximize the performance of the stock 2.8 (and I'm not talking about nitrous or forced induction guys). So I have basic plans to get a funnel ram style intake, I already have a hi-flow muffler (from west coast fiero), power pulleys, headers (is it worth it?)...etc. <P>So I was just wondering what kind of horsepower you guys have gotten from your 2.8's and what kind of mods you did to get it. <P>Thanks alot<BR><P>------------------<BR>-87 Bright Blue Metallic GT-<BR>          -Joel||||reg||5
